; Fits Into These Slots - elseform
;
; Normally managed automatically: right-click a weapon in inventory and use
; the "Allow: Pistol Slot" / "Allow: Binoculars Slot" toggle, which writes
; lines here for you (see zzzz_elseform_fits_slots.script). Hand-editing
; still works the same way.
;
; List only weapons that do NOT already default into the target slot. A
; weapon whose own "slot" ltx key already resolves there (e.g. any slot = 1
; pistol for the pistol slot) needs no entry here — and the toggle won't
; even offer it for such weapons.
;
; Section key is the weapon's own item section name; the value is unused
; (line presence is the flag).

[allow_pistol_slot]

[allow_binoc_slot]
